From: Eduardo Ruiz <335073+eduarbo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 00:05:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Bind only the shown parts of a view and look each file and
 game up once per binding

- A hidden container's elements are not bound until it shows (its own
  visibility is bound first), so a view can hold the layouts and parts of
  other cases without binding them each time.
- The system view's panel, the game list's details, a game list's first
  load and the grid's population check files with the file system cache on,
  and the panel's games ({system:continue}, {global:lastPlayed}) are looked
  up once per binding pass (SystemData::FindPass).
---
